      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks. It looks a lot better. But, to be honest, when I read the original transcript, it felt kind of unprofessional. Do you think the way the customer spoke in the original version had issues with grammar or tone that we should note in the training manual for the reps to watch out for? Like, is that style of speaking okay for a customer, or is it something that usually indicates a problem?",
